{# ===========================================================================
   Pro-upsell notice — shown to Solo above a Pro-only settings area.
   Param: feature (human label of the gated feature).
   The Solo edition can't enable or reconfigure these; a site downgraded from Pro
   keeps whatever it already had running (the runtime is edition-blind) and can
   turn it off here.
   =========================================================================== #}
{% if not craft.simpleForm.isPro() %}
    <blockquote class="note">
        <strong>{{ 'Pro feature.'|t('simple-form') }}</strong>
        {{ '{feature} is part of the Pro edition. The Solo edition can’t enable or reconfigure it; a site downgraded from Pro keeps anything it already had running and can switch it off here.'|t('simple-form', { feature: feature ?? 'This feature'|t('simple-form') }) }}
    </blockquote>
{% endif %}
